/photo_gallery/picture/14683462350/DZUsa2ohMeW.jpg\"},{\"current_url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/bekasikota.setda/?_showcaption=true\",\"snapshot_date\":1780918973731,\"id\":\"DY_kxGyBoRN\",\"image\":\"https://scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/709842232_18150109054494351_3927857642163947612_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ig_cache_key=MzkwOTAwNDcwNTc5MTM3ODUwOQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkZFRUQueHBpZHMuMTM1MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=2btOV5n33NIQ7kNvwHsw-VV&_nc_oc=AdqOzaS2n5b73lv7ZfalvZQrbFTT7N-qloJTFoleITAj8ayQBO-ZIAkh9ANvaKxCgfI&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=SztmarsJ1DI481b1JOKGmA&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_Af9Tl5v9mylVh5ZG_NYhuLjXij0Il_HSEjuciwtgy0cSvg&oe=6A2C8F23\",\"caption\":\"Selamat memperingati Hari Raya Waisak 2570 BE/2026 M\\n\\nMomen ini mengingatkan kita pada nilai welas asih, pengendalian diri, dan penghormatan terhadap sesama makhluk. \\n\\nMari jadikan semangat Waisak sebagai energi untuk membangun Kota Bekasi yang damai dan rukun.\\n\\n#harirayawaisak \\n#kotabekasi \\n#kotapatriot \\n#kotabekasikeren\",\"post_time\":1780209806,\"owner\":\"14683462350\",\"username\":\"bekasikota.setda\",\"comment_count\":0,\"like_count\":7,\"cdn_image\":\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/14683462350/DY_kxGyBoRN.jpg\"},{\"current_url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/bekasikota.setda/?_showcaption=true\",\"snapshot_date\":1780918973731,\"id\":\"DY0v2_bTvsw\",\"image\":\"https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/706357347_18149661013494351_919911731955821988_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ig_cache_key=MzkwNTk1NzI2Mzk3ODcyNDE0NA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkZFRUQueHBpZHMuMTM1MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=K9LmIP_AVlsQ7kNvwF1gddK&_nc_oc=AdpSEEvxonVrO4hnnY0BToscdZP98VCv3CccUQdp57JXQoDoY5g2aFzmpZVGs84SL0M&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.c