, exhause dll. Pembina juga melakukan pengecekan kelayakan alat2 bantuan bencana seperti perahu , pelampung , mesin perahu, terpal, kantong mayat, dayung, helm.\\n\\n#kecamatanmustikajaya\\n#kotabekasi\\n@mastriadhianto \\n@harris.bobihoe \\n@pemkot_bekasi\\n@humaskotabekasi\\n@diskominfobekasi\\n@jayasetiawan1975\",\"post_time\":1753433270,\"owner\":\"3252462986\",\"cdn_image\":\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/3252462986/3684387769985689050_3252462986.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"DMfgg8SyDDJ\",\"image\":\"https://scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/522069727_18412076764110987_8927181458062940052_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ig_cache_key=MzY4MzgwNjAwOTcyODA0MTQ3MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InhwaWRzLjEwODB4MTM1MC5zZHIuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=F13cC3MtG3cQ7kNvwH-tbvS&_nc_oc=Adk3T5qLNZvR9xSozr9j96DTYAp9sT5dvaWkoceg5X-NnXXKaS0mMjCSjI22l5FF3M4&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=MJ9ylaim2v110NTTuEV2lg&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyfzq_sm0hvWPyR9JYzi7EKTuaTARCQ8-WfapLT5F9qug&oe=69AC8D2D\",\"caption\":\"Plt. Sekcam dan Kasi Pemerintahan Mustikajaya Ikut hadir dalam Rapat dan Survey penggunaan lokasi untuk Mako Polsek Mustikajaya.\\n\\n#kecamatanmustikajaya \\n#kotabekasi \\n@mastriadhianto \\n@harris.bobihoe \\n@pemkot_bekasi \\n@jayasetiawan1975\",\"post_time\":1753363920,\"owner\":\"3252462986\",\"cdn_image\":\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/3252462986/3683806021463584969_3252462986.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"DMffIXfyPYu\",\"image\":\"https://scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/522296790_18412074763110987_3928747100156008943_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=MzY4Mzc5OTkyOTIyODg0OTU0Mw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InhwaWRzLjEwODB4MTM1MC5zZHIuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=PdLK9ow1PTMQ7kNvwGZyiKV&_nc_oc=Adl2fB9hB-qpJuQaoHdzjdul6krDLu5HiRx7aGbMdAS3iQQppj7oNzg7fe5RzDeCt_c&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_