tuk saling menguatkan, menumbuhkan empati, serta menghadirkan kebahagiaan sederhana bagi sesama.\\nSemoga kebaikan kecil yang dibagikan hari ini membawa keberkahan dan manfaat bagi seluruh warga. 🤲\\n#jumatberkah \\n#kelurahanpengasinankotabekasi \\n#rawalumbubekasi \\n#kotabekasikeren \\n#pedulisesama \\n\\n@mastriadhianto \\n@harris.bobihoe \\n@pemkot_bekasi \\n@kecrawalumbu \\n@humaskotabekasi \\n@diskominfobekasi \\n@tapem_kotabekasi\",\"post_time\":1766120655,\"owner\":\"44455404033\",\"cdn_image\":\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/44455404033/3790815748655580081_6442423709.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"DSZF8lJjcqv\",\"image\":\"https://scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/602796983_18087890615484034_1918658553103344091_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p720x720_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=Mzc5MDA4NjcxNDY5ODg3NzYxNQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InhwaWRzLjEwODB4MTkyMC5zZHIuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=ibV3Z4_zYHoQ7kNvwFdhRWo&_nc_oc=AdnUcdsXhZ24AOEE5LklrDn66oB1HxNUqnHvWGZWlVePZzHdUgY2Ak_f5nvGA8g1pQg&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=_g7IYyTryXLSGmMoVA_jYg&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy-Eu-QdCdhE5U6SvuneZ14zqgNdgkCBu6uO7Q1tNHAPQ&oe=69AC7645\",\"caption\":\"Giat Pasar Murah Bersubsidi yang dilaksanakan di Halaman Parkir Kantor Kecamatan Rawalumbu.\\n\\n@mastriadhianto\\n@harris.bobihoe\\n@elly_zie\\n@yudistiraa.536\\n@pemkot_bekasi\\n@prokopimkotabekasi\\n@humaskotabekasi\\n\\n#bekasi #kotabekasi #bekasikeren #rawalumbu #rawalumbutangguh #kecamatanrawalumbu\",\"post_time\":1766033593,\"owner\":\"44455404033\",\"cdn_image\":\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/44455404033/3790086714698877615_44455404033.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"DSZFKq5kqvm\",\"image\":\"https://scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/599138771_18330415390215710_8801998298964077276_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ig_cache_key=Mzc5MDA4MzI4NDg5OTM3NjEwMg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cda