agai inspirasi untuk terus berkarya, bergotong royong, serta memberikan pelayanan terbaik bagi masyarakat demi terwujudnya Indonesia yang adil, makmur, dan berkeadaban.\\n\\n\\\"Memperkokoh Ideologi Pancasila, Menuju Indonesia Raya.\\\"\\n\\nSelamat Memperingati Hari Lahir Pancasila\\n1 Juni 2026\\n\\n@mastriadhianto\\n@harris.bobihoe \\n@amandapratiwi_10 \\n@karya_sukmajaya \\n@kecamatanbekasiselatan \\n\\n#HariLahirPancasila2026 #Pancasila #KelurahanPekayonJaya #BekasiKeren #BerAKHLAK BanggaMelayaniBangsa IndonesiaRaya PPIDPekayonJaya PancasilaPerekatBangsa 🇮🇩\",\"post_time\":1780287644,\"owner\":\"7553016190\",\"username\":\"kelurahan_pekayonjaya\",\"comment_count\":0,\"like_count\":20,\"cdn_image\":\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/7553016190/DZB5cFMTB5j.jpg\"},{\"current_url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/kelurahan_pekayonjaya/?_showcaption=true\",\"snapshot_date\":1780917096560,\"id\":\"DY0l1beTsjn\",\"image\":\"https://scontent-sin11-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/705968662_18328185625248191_1627626439853810089_n.webp?stp=dst-webp_p720x720&_nc_cat=105&ig_cache_key=MzkwNTkxMzE3NjE4OTc0OTQ3OQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkZFRUQueHBpZHMuMTQ0MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=TQLxHGmhJKAQ7kNvwExafg4&_nc_oc=AdrQC9srKx7_uwdGZ0CQKtL-xOKPl-BRnoYmWjKZYZWHivBZgUD5KWLWd6DyzzvT2aU&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=ghc8au4yVOvgAXrboSiTDQ&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_Af9tzK0-aAX0nJhMTRl0Kp334ZVFHmAYWanjeQWiLgv1ZA&oe=6A2C8A29\",\"caption\":\"Selamat Hari Raya Idul Adha 1447 Hijriah.\",\"post_time\":1779841159,\"owner\":\"7553016190\",\"username\":\"kelurahan_pekayonjaya\",\"comment_count\":0,\"like_count\":14,\"cdn_image\":\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/7553016190/DY0l1beTsjn.jpg\"},{\"current_url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/kelurahan_pekayonjaya/?_showcaption=true\",\"snapshot_date\":1780917096560,\"id\":\"DYzEO21k-__\",\"image\":\"https://sc