dan RT.004 RW.008 Kelurahan Bekasijaya Kecamatan Bekasi Timur. \\n\\n@harris.bobihoe @arie_halimatussadiyyah @martinaharyati @hemis.ismana @diskominfobekasi @kecamatan_bekasi_timur \\n\\n#kotabekasi #kecamatanbekasitimur #kelurahanbekasijaya\",\"post_time\":1768740354,\"owner\":\"7875029476\",\"cdn_image\":\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/7875029476/3812788957588140262_7875029476.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"DTpIvtxidW7\",\"image\":\"https://scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/619177920_1057657963203002_7600260343089502824_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ig_cache_key=MzgxMjYxNzAyMjg4MjgyOTc1NQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InhwaWRzLjY0MHgxMTM4LnNkci5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=vHYOqFijU18Q7kNvwGm55qB&_nc_oc=AdkpMfpTT-qPNWS0oDMIVdOnkOn9_Z2SvOyNjmu-mnf-y-bOxxCQ2K9XTwcTY2Vgy7Q&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=7h5BWoPKTcgmDqQWTveDhg&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzbqYybpfmPCGibi3-2IcvrIWlF1VcmaY65jdqrKdUAjg&oe=69AC9215\",\"caption\":\"Kegiatan mlm puncak penggalangan donasi korban bencana alam di aceh dan sumatera ini adalah wujud kepedulian & aksi nyata solidaritas  kita unk meringankan beban saudara2 kt yg terdampak bencana di berbagai wilayah Aceh & Sumatera.\\n\\n@mastriadhianto \\n@harris.bobihoe \\n@arie_halimatussadiyyah \\n@kelurahan_bekasijaya \\n@kelurahanmargahayu \\n@kelurahan_durenjaya \\n@kelurahan_arenjaya \\n\\n#kecamatanbekasitimur #bekasitimurmaju \\n#bekasitimurjuara #melayanidenganhati❤️\",\"post_time\":1768719492,\"owner\":\"7875029476\",\"cdn_image\":\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/7875029476/3812617022882829755_5866770700.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"DTnUPRKEg_A\",\"image\":\"https://scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/616233310_1203326791908687_1741852002665290207_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=MzgxMjEwNDYxOTczNzM1NDE3Ng%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InhwaWRzLjY0MHgxMTM2LnNkci5DMyJ9&_nc_o